<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 75.2005 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 75.2005 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.2005 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Tuesday after 75.2600 on Monday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     July 15		 July 14</p>
<p> High			     75.2700		 75.5800</p>
<p> Low				75.1999		 75.2000</p>
<p> Open			     75.2700		 75.4000</p>
<p> Close			    75.2005		 75.2600</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	     2.450		  4.015</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
